'kaṇṭha-bandha|kaṇṭha + bandha|Ṣaṣṭhī-tatpuruṣa|Binding of the throat.;rāja-danta-stha-jihvā|rāja + danta + stha + jihvā|Nested tatpuruṣa and karmadhāraya|Tongue situated at the “royal teeth”: danta tooth, stha situated, jihvā tongue.',
